प्रति-√ दृश् (ind.p. -दृश्य), to look at, behold, perceive, notice, ŚBr.;
 Ā. and Pass. -दृश्यते, to become visible, appear, appear as, be, RV. &c. &c.:
Caus. -दर्शयति, to cause to see, show, teach, MBh.

प्रति-√ दा P. Ā. -ददाति, -दत्ते, to give back, restore, return, AV. &c. &c.;
to give, offer, present, MBh.; R. :
Caus. -दापयति, to cause to be given back or restored, Yājñ.

प्रति-√ 2. दिव् P. -दीव्यति, to throw or cast against, Pāṇ. ii, 3, 59, Sch.;
to play at dice with (acc.),
to stake anything (gen. or acc.) at dice against, AV.; MBh.
